  "review": [
    "Authored fresh; no settled twin, no chorus field. 4×5 printed lines. Glossaries: צוּר הָעוֹלָמִים for صخر الدهور, מַחֲסֶה for محتماي, יֵשׁוּעַ (never בישו). The printed \"?\" on 3:4 dropped per house style. 4:3 renders نفسي أنسى as \"I forget my soul/self so that I see You\"."
